    "title": "Kaya's Holiday Treat",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya's summer holiday finally began.",
      "She packed her new suitcase.",
      "First, they rode a public bus.",
      "Kaya felt a little scared then.",
      "Kaya asked, \"Why is it so loud?\"",
      "Her mother said, \"Because many people were talking.\"",
      "After the trip, Kaya was very tired.",
      "They found a shop and bought a cake.",
      "Kaya took a thin slice of strawberry cake.",
      "Once, she ate such a delicious cake twice!",
      "She felt so free and happy then."
